   "text": "deliver x   ->  record 'x' + counter + 5   (one commit)\ndeliver x   ->  'x' already recorded  ->  skip\n\nCounter ends at +5. The world changed once.",
   "originalText": "deliver x   ->  record 'x' + counter + 5   (one commit)\ndeliver x   ->  'x' already recorded  ->  skip\n\nCounter ends at +5. The world changed once.",
