   "text": "write effect to DB   +   commit Kafka offset\n\ncrash in between  ->  message replayed\n\ncure: INBOX\n('I processed this' commits with the effect)",
   "originalText": "write effect to DB   +   commit Kafka offset\n\ncrash in between  ->  message replayed\n\ncure: INBOX\n('I processed this' commits with the effect)",
