   "updated": 1795651200000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Do not chase distributed transactions. Make the DB write IDEMPOTENT, so that a replay is harmless.\nThe inbox is the general way to do that.",
   "originalText": "Do not chase distributed transactions. Make the DB write IDEMPOTENT, so that a replay is harmless.\nThe inbox is the general way to do that.",
