   "text": "What if Tx1 ROLLS BACK instead?  Its row vanishes, Tx2 wakes up, INSERTS the row itself and applies the effect.\nIn every case EXACTLY ONE transaction applies the effect.",
   "originalText": "What if Tx1 ROLLS BACK instead?  Its row vanishes, Tx2 wakes up, INSERTS the row itself and applies the effect.\nIn every case EXACTLY ONE transaction applies the effect.",
