   "updated": 1795651200000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Also avoid auto-commit tied to 'message was delivered to the handler': commit manually, after the transaction.\nOffsets and inbox are independent safety nets: a replay from an older offset is just a stream of duplicates.",
   "originalText": "Also avoid auto-commit tied to 'message was delivered to the handler': commit manually, after the transaction.\nOffsets and inbox are independent safety nets: a replay from an older offset is just a stream of duplicates.",
