   "text": "Idempotent AND order-tolerant, with no id table.\nNeeds a monotonic per-aggregate version in the payload (the outbox event\ndesign puts one there).",
   "originalText": "Idempotent AND order-tolerant, with no id table.\nNeeds a monotonic per-aggregate version in the payload (the outbox event\ndesign puts one there).",
