   "text": "Effects that ACCUMULATE: counters, balances, append-only logs. Applying +5\ntwice gives +10. Use the inbox, or make the delta idempotent by id.",
   "originalText": "Effects that ACCUMULATE: counters, balances, append-only logs. Applying +5\ntwice gives +10. Use the inbox, or make the delta idempotent by id.",
