   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Persist consumed offsets in the same DB transaction as the effect, seek to them on assignment.\nExactly-once processing for DB sinks without per-message ids; costs custom rebalance / seek logic.",
   "originalText": "Persist consumed offsets in the same DB transaction as the effect, seek to them on assignment.\nExactly-once processing for DB sinks without per-message ids; costs custom rebalance / seek logic.",
