   "updated": 1795651200000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Retention rule of thumb: keep inbox ids at least as long as the longest topic retention of the consumed topic, plus a margin.\nFor the events table the permanent unique key makes retention a non-issue.",
