   "updated": 1795651200000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Two transactions can both SELECT 'not found' and both proceed. The index insert is atomic:\none wins, the other waits, then gets rowCount 0.",
   "originalText": "Two transactions can both SELECT 'not found' and both proceed. The index insert is atomic:\none wins, the other waits, then gets rowCount 0.",
